WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:12.274
Price alerts: the bell beside the stock name.

2
00:00:12.274 --> 00:00:15.315
Quick ±1% and ±2% levels, or any price, with a note.

3
00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.524
The alert shows as a dotted line on the chart.

4
00:00:17.524 --> 00:00:20.659
Rally the price through it with the Demo simulator:

5
00:00:20.659 --> 00:00:24.171
A toast the moment it crosses. It fires once.

6
00:00:24.171 --> 00:00:28.332
The notification centre: alerts, fills and trailing stops, in IST.

7
00:00:28.332 --> 00:00:30.758
Price alerts, with this one marked Triggered.
